<title>USA: Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.72 percent, up one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.62 percent, up one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.01 percent, up five basis points from last week.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.72%   5.71%  1/16/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.62%   5.61%  1/16/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.01%   5.96%  1/16/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
